# One directory per committed gem5 full-system run (gem5 -d results/fs_hmat/<run>).
# Keep the report, the ROI stats, the guest's output and how the run was started; the rest
# (stats.txt, config.*, the serial console, the sparse swap image) is large or regenerated.
/*/*
!/*/fs_result.json
!/*/roi_stats.json
!/*/guest_output.txt
!/*/run.json
# A run a cap stopped early, and the ROI's progress curve (a few hundred bytes each).
!/*/roi_capped.json
!/*/roi_progress.json
